From 839f8203034775d4d6d004048ab47e19f0986e62
Subject: web-worker: pace the app from the render worker's animation frames
Origin: https://github.com/robtfm/bevy/commit/839f8203034775d4d6d004048ab47e19f0986e62
Date: 2026-09-18T23:45:15+01:00

The render task now waits for the worker's requestAnimationFrame before
collecting the render app, and signals the app world once it has taken it.
`RenderAppChannels::send_blocking` waits for that signal on the web, so the
app world cannot run past the end of a frame until the render worker has
picked the frame up inside its rAF callback, and the canvas commits on the
display's cadence. bevy_winit switches the app worker to the Immediate
redraw strategy under the feature, since the render side now paces it.
---
